    "type_designations": ["ZM510-SD4"],
    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "Avery Weigh-Tronix ZM510-SD4 indicating device: programmable, self-indicating, mains-powered, designed to be used as part of a Class III or IIII Non-Automatic Weighing Instrument. Designation format 'Prefix-XYZ': ZM510 = standard indicator; S = stainless enclosure; D = desktop mounting; 4 = dot graphic display (green background with black dots). Features 48 operational keys including a QWERTY keypad and 5 soft keys (F1-F5). Devices: semi-automatic zero setting (≤4% Max), zero tracking (≤4% Max), semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing, pre-set tare, recall of gross indication when tare active, determination and indication of stability of equilibrium, checking of display, printing, PLUs, alibi storage, gravity compensation, real-time clock, command via external device (PC), status indicators (Gross, Net, Tare, Preset tare, Print, Zero, Motion, Accumulation, Over/Under weight, Network, Battery), single or multi-range / multi-interval operation, range-in-use indicators (multi-range variant), connection to digital load cells. Standard interfaces: load cell 4-wire or 6-wire shielded connection, 3 logic level inputs, 3 open collector outputs, 2 RS232 serial ports, 10/100 Ethernet, USB host. Legally relevant software AWT30-500208, protected via sealed jumper on main board or password with incrementing counters."
  },
